        "english_translation": "In the evening, I went home alone. The door is locked, but a window has been left open. The light in the room has been left on too. Someone might be inside. Holding an umbrella, I went in very quietly. There is nobody in the kitchen, nor on the bed. Raising the umbrella high, I said in a loud voice, \"Who is it?\" There was no answer. I thought for a little while. It was me who opened the window and turned on the light in the morning. The weather was good that day, and I did not need the umbrella.",
